                              UN/EDIFACT

                      Draft directory for test purposes

       This is not a UNECE publication. It is a hand written sample that
       follows the layout of the UNTDID batch files, used to test schema
       generation from a locally supplied directory.

4.3    Message structure

4.3.1  Segment table

Pos    Tag Name                                      S   R

           HEADER SECTION

0010   UNH Message header                            M   1
0020   BGM Beginning of message                      M   1
0030   NAD Name and address                          C   9

0040       ----- Segment group 1  ------------------ C   5-----------+
0050   RFF Reference                                 M   1           |
0060   TAX Duty/tax/fee details                      C   5-----------+

0070   UNT Message trailer                           M   1
